The critical endpoint Match-V5

Then endpoint
 /lol/match/v5/matches/{matchId}
gives a general and time-agnostic overview of the game, while 
The /lol/match/v5/matches/{matchId}/timeline 
endpoint gives frame-by-frame data of all of the game's statuses.  

Endpoints that howtowin.lol might access include:

Champion-V3/Champion-Rotation	For the 'try a new champion' feature


